 "comment": "statutory_dues_43b, vouchers that share a GUID on employees' contributions (#1243). PF: an opening lot paid by two blank-GUID payments, one by its due date and one after; one GUID on May's deduction and on its late payment; one GUID, number, type and day on July's two deductions (one ref, both counted), paid on time; a blank-GUID payment with no number left as an unmatched advance. ESI: one GUID on a payment of the opening lot and on a later deduction; an opening remainder still unpaid; May's deduction in the PF voucher (its payment, sharing that GUID, has no ESI line and is not cited on ESI); two blank-GUID March deductions with identical refs, due after the year end. Every figure and finding of the walk cites each voucher of its nature.",
